---
import Picture from './Picture.astro';
import { existsSync } from 'node:fs';
import { join } from 'node:path';

// La photo remplace automatiquement le visuel d'attente après le déploiement.
// Déposer un vrai JPEG dans public/images/mot-du-directeur.jpg.
const photo = '/images/mot-du-directeur.jpg';
const hasPhoto = existsSync(join(process.cwd(), 'public', 'images', 'mot-du-directeur.jpg'));
---

<section id="mot-du-directeur" class="director-section" aria-labelledby="director-title">
	<div class="director-wrap">
		<div class="director-panel">
			<div class="director-content">
				<p class="director-pill"><span aria-hidden="true"></span> Le mot du directeur</p>
				<h2 id="director-title">Habiller des ambitions, <span>pas seulement des tenues.</span></h2>

				<!-- Texte proposé : à personnaliser dès réception du mot du directeur. -->
				<div class="director-quote-card">
					<span class="director-quote-mark" aria-hidden="true">“</span>
					<blockquote>Une tenue réussie ne se contente pas de vêtir : elle donne confiance, rassemble une équipe et porte une ambition.</blockquote>
				</div>

				<div class="director-copy">
					<p>Chaque commande porte une histoire : celle d’une équipe, d’une promotion, d’une entreprise. Chez Confection Univers, nous prenons le temps d’écouter vos attentes pour transformer cette histoire en une tenue juste, durable et soignée.</p>
					<p>Du choix des matières à la dernière finition, notre engagement reste le même : faire de chaque vêtement une source de confiance et de fierté, ici au Sénégal.</p>
				</div>

				<p class="director-signature"><span aria-hidden="true"></span> Ngagne Niang <small>Fondateur &amp; CEO · Confection Univers</small></p>
			</div>

			<figure class="director-portrait">
				<div class="director-photo">
					{hasPhoto ? (
						<Picture src={photo} alt="Portrait de Ngagne Niang, fondateur et CEO de Confection Univers" sizes="(min-width: 1024px) 40vw, 100vw" loading="lazy" />
					) : (
						<div class="director-placeholder" role="img" aria-label="Emplacement réservé au portrait du directeur">
							<span class="placeholder-orbit" aria-hidden="true"></span>
							<span class="placeholder-monogram" aria-hidden="true">CU</span>
							<span class="placeholder-caption">Portrait à venir</span>
						</div>
					)}
					<span class="director-photo-shade" aria-hidden="true"></span>
				</div>
				<span class="director-photo-tag"><span class="tag-dot" aria-hidden="true">✦</span> Fondateur &amp; CEO · Thiès — Sénégal</span>
				<figcaption class="director-identity">
					<span class="identity-mark">CU <span aria-hidden="true">—</span> CONFECTION UNIVERS</span>
					<strong>Ngagne Niang</strong>
					<span>FONDATEUR &amp; CEO · Confection Univers</span>
				</figcaption>
			</figure>
		</div>
	</div>
</section>

<script>
	const section = document.getElementById('mot-du-directeur');
	if (section && 'IntersectionObserver' in window && !window.matchMedia('(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)').matches) {
		section.classList.add('is-ready');
		const observer = new IntersectionObserver(([entry]) => {
			if (entry.isIntersecting) {
				section.classList.add('is-visible');
				observer.disconnect();
			}
		}, { threshold: 0.12 });
		observer.observe(section);
	}
</script>

<style>
	.director-section {
		position: relative;
		overflow: hidden;
		padding: clamp(5rem, 7vw, 7rem) 0 2.5rem;
		background: #f7f5f1;
	}

	.director-wrap {
		width: min(100% - 2.5rem, 1280px);
		margin-inline: auto;
	}

	.director-panel {
		position: relative;
		isolation: isolate;
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 0.84fr) minmax(0, 1.16fr);
		align-items: center;
		gap: clamp(2.25rem, 4.6vw, 5rem);
		min-height: 620px;
		padding: clamp(1.6rem, 3.3vw, 3.3rem);
		overflow: hidden;
		border: 1px solid rgba(250, 204, 107, 0.19);
		border-radius: clamp(22px, 2.3vw, 34px);
		background: linear-gradient(125deg, #111937 0%, #050a2e 49%, #00001c 100%);
		box-shadow: 0 38px 75px -48px rgba(0, 0, 28, 0.5);
		color: #fff;
	}

	.director-panel::before {
		content: '';
		position: absolute;
		z-index: -1;
		inset: 0;
		background:
			radial-gradient(circle at 14% 17%, rgba(250, 204, 107, 0.13), transparent 35%),
			radial-gradient(circle at 94% 85%, rgba(55, 76, 161, 0.22), transparent 39%);
		pointer-events: none;
	}

	.director-content {
		grid-column: 2;
		grid-row: 1;
		min-width: 0;
		padding-block: 0.5rem;
	}

	.director-pill {
		display: inline-flex;
		align-items: center;
		gap: 0.55rem;
		margin: 0 0 1.45rem;
		padding: 0.5rem 0.8rem;
		border: 1px solid rgba(250, 204, 107, 0.34);
		border-radius: 99px;
		background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03);
		color: #f1e6ca;
		font-size: 10px;
		font-weight: 700;
		letter-spacing: 0.08em;
		text-transform: uppercase;
	}

	.director-pill > span {
		width: 5px;
		height: 5px;
		border-radius: 50%;
		background: var(--cu-gold-grad);
		box-shadow: 0 0 12px #facc6b;
	}

	.director-content h2 {
		max-width: 14ch;
		margin: 0;
		font-family: 'Space Grotesk', ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif;
		font-size: clamp(2.55rem, 4.1vw, 4.55rem);
		font-weight: 700;
		line-height: 1.02;
		letter-spacing: -0.065em;
		text-transform: uppercase;
		text-wrap: balance;
	}

	.director-content h2 span {
		color: #facc6b;
	}

	.director-quote-card {
		position: relative;
		margin: clamp(1.65rem, 2.7vw, 2.75rem) 0 1.55rem;
		padding: 1.6rem 1.7rem 1.4rem;
		border: 1px solid rgba(250, 204, 107, 0.22);
		border-radius: 18px;
		background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.045);
		box-shadow: inset 0 1px rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.045);
	}

	.director-quote-mark {
		position: absolute;
		top: -16px;
		left: -10px;
		display: grid;
		width: 32px;
		height: 32px;
		place-items: center;
		border-radius: 50%;
		background: var(--cu-gold-grad);
		color: #00001c;
		font-family: Georgia, serif;
		font-size: 27px;
		line-height: 1;
		padding-top: 8px;
	}

	.director-quote-card blockquote {
		margin: 0;
		color: #f9f5eb;
		font-family: 'Marcellus', Georgia, serif;
		font-size: clamp(1rem, 1.35vw, 1.3rem);
		line-height: 1.55;
	}

	.director-copy {
		max-width: 42rem;
		color: #b8c1d8;
		font-size: clamp(0.9rem, 0.98vw, 1rem);
		line-height: 1.72;
	}

	.director-copy p {
		margin: 0 0 0.95rem;
	}

	.director-signature {
		display: flex;
		align-items: center;
		flex-wrap: wrap;
		gap: 0.65rem;
		margin: 1.15rem 0 0;
		color: #f7e3ac;
		font-family: 'Marcellus', Georgia, serif;
		font-size: 1.05rem;
	}

	.director-signature > span {
		width: 2rem;
		height: 1px;
		background: #c89e54;
	}

	.director-signature small {
		color: #a8b2cb;
		font-family: 'Space Grotesk', ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif;
		font-size: 0.65rem;
		letter-spacing: 0.05em;
		text-transform: uppercase;
	}

	.director-portrait {
		position: relative;
		grid-column: 1;
		grid-row: 1;
		width: min(100%, 430px);
		margin: 0;
	}

	.director-photo {
		position: relative;
		aspect-ratio: 0.78;
		overflow: hidden;
		border: 1px solid rgba(250, 204, 107, 0.48);
		border-radius: 21px;
		background: #14214c;
	}

	.director-photo :global(img) {
		display: block;
		width: 100%;
		height: 100%;
		object-fit: cover;
		object-position: center 24%;
	}

	.director-photo-shade {
		position: absolute;
		inset: 0;
		pointer-events: none;
		background: linear-gradient(180deg, transparent 58%, rgba(0, 0, 28, 0.38) 100%);
	}

	.director-placeholder {
		position: absolute;
		inset: 0;
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		align-items: center;
		justify-content: center;
		background:
			radial-gradient(circle at 49% 41%, rgba(250, 204, 107, 0.22), transparent 44%),
			linear-gradient(135deg, #18285b, #00001c 85%);
	}

	.placeholder-orbit {
		position: absolute;
		width: 74%;
		aspect-ratio: 1;
		border: 1px dashed rgba(250, 204, 107, 0.3);
		border-radius: 50%;
	}

	.placeholder-monogram {
		position: relative;
		margin-right: 0.12em;
		color: #f0d9a4;
		font-family: 'Space Grotesk', ui-sans-serif, system-ui, sans-serif;
		font-size: clamp(6rem, 11vw, 9rem);
		font-weight: 600;
		letter-spacing: -0.18em;
		line-height: 1;
	}

	.placeholder-caption {
		position: relative;
		margin-top: 0.75rem;
		color: #facc6b;
		font-size: 10px;
		font-weight: 700;
		letter-spacing: 0.2em;
		text-transform: uppercase;
	}

	.director-photo-tag {
		position: absolute;
		z-index: 2;
		top: -11px;
		left: -10px;
		display: inline-flex;
		align-items: center;
		gap: 0.5rem;
		max-width: calc(100% + 10px);
		padding: 0.55rem 0.75rem;
		border-radius: 999px;
		background: #fffaf0;
		box-shadow: 0 7px 22px rgba(0, 0, 28, 0.22);
		color: #142046;
		font-size: 10px;
		font-weight: 700;
		white-space: nowrap;
	}

	.tag-dot {
		display: grid;
		flex: none;
		width: 1.1rem;
		height: 1.1rem;
		place-items: center;
		border-radius: 50%;
		background: var(--cu-gold-grad);
		color: #00001c;
		font-size: 0.65rem;
	}

	.director-identity {
		position: absolute;
		z-index: 2;
		right: 16px;
		bottom: 16px;
		left: 16px;
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		gap: 0.2rem;
		padding: 1rem 1.2rem;
		border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.75);
		border-radius: 16px;
		background: rgba(255, 250, 240, 0.97);
		box-shadow: 0 14px 35px rgba(0, 0, 20, 0.17);
		color: #111b3b;
	}

	.identity-mark {
		color: #a47936;
		font-size: 9px;
		font-weight: 800;
		letter-spacing: 0.08em;
	}

	.identity-mark span {
		margin-inline: 0.2rem;
	}

	.director-identity strong {
		font-size: 1rem;
		font-weight: 700;
	}

	.director-identity > span:last-child {
		color: #626c80;
		font-size: 0.75rem;
	}

	@media (min-width: 901px) {
		.director-section.is-ready .director-content,
		.director-section.is-ready .director-portrait {
			opacity: 0;
			transform: translateY(22px);
			transition: opacity 0.75s ease, transform 0.75s ease;
		}

		.director-section.is-visible .director-content,
		.director-section.is-visible .director-portrait {
			opacity: 1;
			transform: translateY(0);
		}

		.director-section.is-visible .director-content {
			transition-delay: 0.1s;
		}
	}

	@media (max-width: 900px) {
		.director-panel {
			grid-template-columns: 1fr;
			gap: 2.5rem;
			min-height: 0;
		}

		.director-content,
		.director-portrait {
			grid-column: 1;
			grid-row: auto;
		}

		.director-content h2 {
			max-width: 16ch;
		}

		.director-portrait {
			width: min(100%, 440px);
			margin-inline: auto;
		}
	}

	@media (max-width: 599px) {
		.director-section {
			padding: 5.5rem 0 1.4rem;
		}

		.director-panel {
			gap: 2.75rem;
			padding: 1.45rem;
		}

		.director-content h2 {
			font-size: clamp(2.35rem, 10vw, 3.3rem);
		}

		.director-quote-card {
			padding: 1.4rem 1.15rem 1.2rem;
		}

		.director-copy {
			font-size: 0.9rem;
		}

		.director-signature {
			font-size: 0.95rem;
		}

		.director-identity {
			right: 12px;
			bottom: 12px;
			left: 12px;
			padding: 0.85rem 1rem;
		}

		.director-photo-tag {
			font-size: 9px;
		}
	}

	@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
		.director-content,
		.director-portrait {
			transition: none !important;
		}
	}
</style>
